# Don't touch! in Russian: aspect in commands
subtitle: "Не трогай but не урони, покрась but крась дальше: which aspect a Russian command takes, as Tom and Софья paint his new restaurant."
tags: ["russian","russian imperative","aspect in commands","не трогай","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/aspect","vocabulary/work"]
thumb: "band \"Don't touch! in Russian\" stamp \"WET PAINT\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"A formal Russian letter: Обращаюсь к Вам с просьбой","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/205-russian-formal-request.cast"}

