    '|a||Don''t touch! in Russian: aspect in commands':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4640
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Не трогай but не урони, покрась but крась дальше: which aspect a Russian command takes, as Tom and Софья paint his new restaurant.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1m7ugkx'
    '|a||Commands in Russian, and which aspect they take. Нача́ло октября́: догово́р подпи́сан, разреше́ние на ремо́нт есть.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9320
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||В воскресе́нье мы с Со́фьей кра́сим сте́ны в но́вом помеще́нии. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:idtmg'
    '|a||Со́фья, осторо́жно! Не тро́гай э́ту сте́ну — кра́ска ещё мо́края.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:qyh7do'
    '|b||Хорошо́. А э́ту покра́сить?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2560
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Да, покра́сь, пожа́луйста. То́лько аккура́тно, не урони́ кра́ску!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5000
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Не бо́йся. Том, а дверь не открыва́ется.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4480
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Не толка́й её, тяни́ на себя́. На́до её почини́ть.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Ой, я что́-то слома́ла? Свет не включа́ется.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3960
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Нажми́… Ну, нажима́й же! Вот! Ничего́ ты не слома́ла.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Том, мо́жно тебе́ что́-то сказа́ть? Мы с Ди́мой встреча́емся.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4640
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Пра́вда? Я так рад! Расска́зывай!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3600
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Пото́м расскажу́. Иди́ крась, ещё три стены́!':
