      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Иди́ крась, ещё три стены́!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2920
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Но́вые слова́. Кра́ска: paint. Кра́сить, покра́сить: to paint. Аккура́тно: carefully.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11480
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Тро́гать, тро́нуть: to touch. Урони́ть: to drop. Слома́ть: to break. Почини́ть: to fix.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:wue2lj'
    '|a||Включи́ть, вы́ключить свет: on and off. Нажа́ть, нажима́ть: to press.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1u1c5ak'
    '|a||На двери́ пи́шут: к себе́ — тяни́, to pull; от себя́ — толка́й, to push.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:cld5eg'
    '|a||Мы с Ди́мой встреча́емся: они́ вме́сте. И иди́, from идти́: иди́ крась!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1eru170'
    '|a||Посмотри́те: кома́нды. Done colour, doing colour.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4520
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1p3ofvv'
    '|a||Покра́сь э́ту сте́ну: оди́н результа́т, the done verb. Почини́ дверь. Нажми́ сюда́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:doomrm'
    '|a||The doing verb: начина́й, продолжа́й, приглаша́й. Крась да́льше! Расска́зывай! Сади́тесь!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:14hnjqn'
    '|a||А с не — из уро́ка сто три́дцать пять: не тро́гай — нельзя́; не урони́ — осторо́жно!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:4g06ek'
    '|a||Про́сим: покра́сь. Приглаша́ем: сади́тесь. Запреща́ем: не тро́гай. Повтори́те.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:7chucz'
    '|a||И ещё одно́. Нажми́… Ничего́. Ну, нажима́й же! Asked again, impatient: often the doing verb.':
