      ms: 10440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1608x6y'
    '|a||Тепе́рь вы. Вы́берите.':
